    "input": "search_query: Dear Northwind Outdoor Support Team,\n\nI hope this message finds you well. I am writing to you regarding my recent order of a new mountain bike and some camping gear. I have been a loyal customer for many years and truly appreciate the quality of your products. However, I am facing a bit of a difficulty with the final costs. I noticed that customs duties are extra and vary by country, often around 20%. This additional charge was not clearly indicated in my initial quote, and it has put a significant strain on my fixed retirement budget.\n\nI understand that these fees are standard, but I was wondering if there might be any flexibility or a possible exception in this case? I am not asking for a full refund, as I do value the items, but perhaps a small credit or a waiver of the shipping fee could help balance out the unexpected duty costs. I am simply asking for your understanding and assistance in resolving this matter amicably. Thank you very much for your time and consideration.\n\nSincerely,\nA Grateful Customer",
